==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|grc|en}} {{m|grc|ἀφορῐστικος}}, equivalent to {{suffix|aphorist|ic|lang=en}}.

===Adjective===
{{head|en|adjective}}

# Of, relating to, or containing [[aphorism]]s, [[maxim]]s or [[epigram]]s; [[gnomic]].
#* De Quincey:
#*: The method of the book is '''aphoristic'''.

